        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Venture into a calm, immersive journey across strange new worlds.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not your typical high-octane action game. Instead, it's a unique, physics-driven experience designed for adult players who enjoy taking their time, exploring at their own pace, and getting lost in procedurally generated and handcrafted environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built by a solo developer from the ground up—including its custom engine—this game offers:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Planetary Landing and Exploration</strong>: Land on planets, walk their surfaces, and feel the terrain through realistic, physics-based animation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Physics Systems</strong>: Enjoy dynamic cloth and soft-body physics and nuanced character interactions that bring life to the world in subtle ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Storytelling</strong>: Meet memorable characters and uncover small stories that evoke the spirit of classic sci-fi, inspired by the more contemplative moments of <i>Star Trek</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slow-Paced Gameplay</strong>: Relax, solve light puzzles, take in the view, and experience a world that doesn't rush you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Personal Project</strong>: This is a labor of love. It's not built in Unreal or by a big studio—just one person driven by passion. Don’t expect cutting-edge graphics or AAA-level animation. This is a small, indie project with a focus on atmosphere, physics, and creativity—not visual spectacle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is free to play. If players enjoy it, there may be an extended add-on in the future. It's not for everyone—but if you’re looking for something different, something calm and thoughtful with a touch of sci-fi nostalgia, this might be exactly what you’ve been waiting for.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Venture into a calm, immersive journey across strange new worlds.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not your typical high-octane action game. Instead, it's a unique, physics-driven experience designed for adult players who enjoy taking their time, exploring at their own pace, and getting lost in procedurally generated and handcrafted environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built by a solo developer from the ground up—including its custom engine—this game offers:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Planetary Landing and Exploration</strong>: Land on planets, walk their surfaces, and feel the terrain through realistic, physics-based animation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Physics Systems</strong>: Enjoy dynamic cloth and soft-body physics and nuanced character interactions that bring life to the world in subtle ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Storytelling</strong>: Meet memorable characters and uncover small stories that evoke the spirit of classic sci-fi, inspired by the more contemplative moments of <i>Star Trek</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slow-Paced Gameplay</strong>: Relax, solve light puzzles, take in the view, and experience a world that doesn't rush you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Personal Project</strong>: This is a labor of love. It's not built in Unreal or by a big studio—just one person driven by passion. Don’t expect cutting-edge graphics or AAA-level animation. This is a small, indie project with a focus on atmosphere, physics, and creativity—not visual spectacle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is free to play. If players enjoy it, there may be an extended add-on in the future. It's not for everyone—but if you’re looking for something different, something calm and thoughtful with a touch of sci-fi nostalgia, this might be exactly what you’ve been waiting for.</p>",
